# Licence

Three parts, three licences, because they are three different kinds of thing.
The full texts are in `LICENSES/`.

## The programs — MIT

`harness/`, and any script or tool in this repository.
See `LICENSES/MIT.txt`. Take them, use them, sell what you build with them.

## The data — CC BY 4.0

The saved runs in `work/rohonc/`, `harness/proposals.json`, the reader's
edition, the alignments, and the mechanical outputs generally.
See `LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`. Build on them; credit this work.

## The translation and the editorial prose — CC BY-NC-ND 4.0

Book One and Book Two as published, the EPUB in `book/`, and the written
documents in this repository: `ROHONC.md`, `CONCLUSION.md`, `TESTS.md`,
`METHOD.md`, `RESULTS.md` and the rest.
See `LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0.txt`.

You may read it, quote it, teach from it, check it and republish it whole for
non-commercial purposes, with credit. You may not sell it, and you may not
publish an altered version of it. **The commercial rights to the English text
are reserved**, because a paperback of it is sold and the text is the thing
being sold.

Nothing here is meant to restrict examining the work. Quotation for review,
criticism, scholarship and reproduction of the results is what this is
published for, and the data and the programs, which are what you need in order
to check it, are under the permissive licences above.

## What is not this project's to license

Levente Zoltán Király and Gábor Tokai's dictionary, grammar and transcription
are their published work. They are not redistributed here and no licence over
them is claimed or implied. The manuscript images belong to the Library of the
Hungarian Academy of Sciences. The manuscript itself is of the sixteenth
century and is out of copyright. `DATA_PROVENANCE.md` states the position on
every file.

